  "title": "Suffix IT Limited : Software Company in Bangladesh",
  "text": "Home\nAbout\nProducts\nIoT\nServices\nCareer\nContact\nE-Commerce Solutions\nE-Commerce Solutions\n\nSuffix IT approach focuses on building an integrated, customized e-business solution for customers. We follow multi-phase, process-driven methodology for our e-commerce/e-business solutions including requirement analysis and definition, data modeling, site security, application testing and quality assurance.\nOur practice involves expertise in portal development frameworks, content management solutions, application servers, middleware integration built by using latest technology platforms.\n\nE-Commerce Solutions We Provide\nThe integrated reservation\nContent Management System\nInventory Management\nMulti Pricing\nAll Major International Credit Cards Process\nOrder Management (History & Tracking)\nGift Certificate and Coupon\nDiscount Coupon Management Banner Management\nBanner Management\nMultiple Payment options\nPayPal\nCheckout\nAuthorize.net\nMulti-Shipping Options\nAffiliate Tracking\nAd Tracking\nE-mail/Auto responders\nShipping Options\nMore Information\nRapidly growing competition and ever-changing marketplace trends have elevated the requirement of efficient shopping cart software program application.There is no finish to attractive and accessible features that a successful e commerce solution must have. But you must be considerate about your budget as well as business needs. Suffix IT offers you an exciting yet affordable range of e commerce solution that can help you achieve your desired profitability, motivating customer service, reducing overheads, and revenues that you dream of.\nSuffix IT supplies a complete end-to-end e commerce solution with regard to businesses and businesses looking for in order to launch and keep the expert and effective store existence on the Web. All of us have a variety of e-commerce options available and due to the vast choice of abilities, this works extremely well to create each shop conceivable, from a little shop to an whole on the internet mall.\nSchedule a Live Demo\nGo for a free practical demonstration in order to experience the user friendly platform of Suffix Field Force Management.\nREQUEST FOR A DEMO\n\nWe maintain strategic partnerships with multiple organizations in Bangladesh and worldwide, working together to deliver high-quality solutions and long-term value.\n\nCONTACT US\n\nCha-70,70/A, Rupayan Millennium Square (9A), Progoti Sharoni, North Badda, Gulshan, Dhaka-1212.\n\ninfo@suffixit.com\n\n+88 01958 424000\n\nQUICK LINKS\nAbout Us\nCareer\nContact Us\n\n© 2026 All Rights Reserved by Suffix IT Limited",
